{% doc %}
  Renders the "Pay once" cost-compare section ported from the prototype homepage v3 (.s3-sec):
  a monthly-usage slider and cloud-model chips drive a live cloud API cost against Tokkey's $0,
  with the "$0 per token. On Mac mini and iPhone too." band underneath. Pricing is placeholder
  copy from the prototype. Behaviour lives in assets/tokkey-cost-compare.js.

  @example
  {% render 'tokkey-cost-compare' %}
{% enddoc %}

<tokkey-cost-compare>
